WEBVTT

00:00:00.785 --> 00:00:01.446
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.492 --> 00:00:04.401
<v><b>Anya:</b></v> This is me and my mum in York.

00:00:04.966 --> 00:00:08.663
It was my first term at university, and she came to visit me,

00:00:08.933 --> 00:00:11.550
and I took her on a tour round the city.

00:00:11.925 --> 00:00:14.283
<v><b>Friend:</b></v> Is that, er, the cathedral there?

00:00:14.521 --> 00:00:20.359
<v><b>Anya:</b></v> Yes – well, it’s called York Minster, but it’s really a cathedral.

00:00:23.124 --> 00:00:23.742
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:28.590
<v><b>Anya:</b></v> And this one’s on the beach in Cornwall with my boyfriend, Ollie.

00:00:29.242 --> 00:00:35.128
I was staying with him in the Easter holidays, and he took me to the beach and we went for a walk.

00:00:35.129 --> 00:00:36.767
<v><b>Friend:</b></v> It looks windy!

00:00:36.815 --> 00:00:39.855
<v><b>Anya:</b></v> Yes, it was really windy and cold.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:43.011
I think we were the only people on the beach!

00:00:44.987 --> 00:00:45.785
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:49.996
<v><b>Friend:</b></v> Nice photo! I like the moustache.

00:00:50.124 --> 00:00:52.584
<v><b>Anya:</b></v> Yeah, that’s me and my friend Maisie.

00:00:53.078 --> 00:00:56.677
We were doing a music course – I do it twice a year,

00:00:56.678 --> 00:01:00.072
and this was at the party at the end of the course.

00:01:00.094 --> 00:01:03.002
<v><b>Friend:</b></v> Why the moustaches and the picture frame?

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:06.017
<v><b>Anya:</b></v> There was this corner that the teachers made

00:01:06.018 --> 00:01:12.422
where people could take funny photos with the big frame, and hats and moustaches and things.

00:01:14.463 --> 00:01:15.146
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:01:16.264 --> 00:01:19.912
<v><b>Anya:</b></v> OK, this one is me and two of my best friends –

00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:21.466
we were at school together.

00:01:22.045 --> 00:01:26.831
One of them, Libby, the one on my right, has a house by the river,

00:01:27.144 --> 00:01:31.085
and we went there in September before we all went to university.

00:01:33.078 --> 00:01:33.923
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:36.284
<v><b>Friend:</b></v> That’s a nice photo.

00:01:36.658 --> 00:01:37.957
In Rome, I guess?

00:01:38.253 --> 00:01:44.429
<v><b>Anya:</b></v> Yes, I was there for a holiday with my mum the summer before I went to university.

00:01:44.962 --> 00:01:48.815
She took this when we were visiting the Colosseum – as you can see.

00:01:50.843 --> 00:01:51.671
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:01:52.685 --> 00:01:54.344
<v><b>Friend:</b></v> That’s your mum again, isn’t it?

00:01:54.688 --> 00:02:01.221
<v><b>Anya:</b></v> Yes, that’s her and her partner, and my sister Roz, on the river in Oxford.

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:07.710
My mum’s birthday is in July, and every year we go punting and then we go for dinner.

00:02:08.235 --> 00:02:12.912
We were all drinking champagne, and Roz was doing the hard work!

00:02:13.481 --> 00:02:15.694
<v><b>Friend:</b></v> Are any of the photos selfies?

00:02:15.742 --> 00:02:21.283
<v><b>Anya:</b></v> Yes, the one of me and my mum and the one on the beach.